    <!-- A Mugirl who escaped from a slave caravan has wandered here, her tattered restraints still bound to her, telling of the suffering she endured as a slave. You can attempt to rescue and recruit her. -->
    <MooGirl_SlaveWandererJoins.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>从奴隶商队逃脱的雪牛娘流浪到这里，破旧束具仍缠绕身上，诉说着她被奴隶的悲惨经历。你可以尝试救助并驯服她。</MooGirl_SlaveWandererJoins.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
